 "sentences": [
  "Conjoined twins left land for free food!",
  "Mary and Eliza supposedly lived for 34 years joined at the shoulder and hip.",
  "Upon death, they bequeathed 5 plots of land to Biddenden.",
  "This income paid for an annual Easter food and drink dole for the poor.",
  "Since 1775, the dole includes hard biscuits imprinted with two conjoined women.",
  "A historian later dismissed the entire story as a folk myth!"
